    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651620/extras/16b436c0ead6423430b6ff7a59a1fd3e.avif?t=1754642408\" width=1232 height=706 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Amentia\u00a0</strong>is an action rpg where you construct your deck of magic cards to survive hordes of enemies and defeat challenging bosses bringers of chaos. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build your deck :</strong>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While surviving assaults from strange creatures you will collect gems and cards filled with magic! Use theses cards wisely to upgrade your character\u2019s skills and gain more power.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All cards unlocked during the game will be available to craft in your collection at the beginning of each run, giving you better chances to survive.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Be aware</i> : the magic trapped within the cards has a cost, you\u2019ll learn it the hard way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What you\u2019ll find in Amentia :</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 maps with 5 levels of difficulty.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 characters, each with unique cards and playstyle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging boss fights.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A real deckbuilding experience where cards matter.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over  60 actives and passives cards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >RNG : your cards are shuffled and drawn in different order.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All hand-drawn visuals and animations.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Choose your gameplay :</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have the possibility to choose when you play your cards in order to unleash powerful combos or to have a more casual experience by using the \u00ab automatic mode \u00bb.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651620/extras/d38f4c26a8284730f2384ff2df2d40f5.avif?t=1754642408\" width=1600 height=382 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651620/extras/16b436c0ead6423430b6ff7a59a1fd3e.avif?t=1754642408\" width=1232 height=706 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Amentia\u00a0</strong>is an action rpg where you construct your deck of magic cards to survive hordes of enemies and defeat challenging bosses bringers of chaos. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build your deck :</strong>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While surviving assaults from strange creatures you will collect gems and cards filled with magic! Use theses cards wisely to upgrade your character\u2019s skills and gain more power.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All cards unlocked during the game will be available to craft in your collection at the beginning of each run, giving you better chances to survive.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Be aware</i> : the magic trapped within the cards has a cost, you\u2019ll learn it the hard way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What you\u2019ll find in Amentia :</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 maps with 5 levels of difficulty.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 characters, each with unique cards and playstyle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging boss fights.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A real deckbuilding experience where cards matter.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over  60 actives and passives cards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >RNG : your cards are shuffled and drawn in different order.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All hand-drawn visuals and animations.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Choose your gameplay :</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have the possibility to choose when you play your cards in order to unleash powerful combos or to have a more casual experience by using the \u00ab automatic mode \u00bb.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651620/extras/d38f4c26a8284730f2384ff2df2d40f5.avif?t=1754642408\" width=1600 height=382 /></span></p>",
